  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-08-05T18:41:14.859Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "#Problem content\nIf the Expression Parameter defined in Online Publishing Avatar is not defined in Offline Testing Avatar, an unexpected value is assigned.\n#Execution environment\n--Unity 2019.4.29f1\n--VRChat Build 1121\n--VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2021.08.04.11.23_Public\n#Reproduction procedure\n1. Upload Online Publishing Avatar and Build Offline Testing Avatar.\n2. After changing to Online Publishing Avatar, change to Offline Testing Avatar.\n3. Ask someone other than yourself to see it.\n4. In the image example, the value other than the value expected by Clothes_Preset is taken, and an unexpected animation is played.\n  --Assumed value, Clothes_Preset: 0-3,10-13,20,21\n#What to fix\nUndefined Expression Parameters should be unchanged or assigned 0 or default values.",
